      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding-right: 64px;">
        <span aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ffc518; color: #232323; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600;">1</span>
        <div>
          <p style="display: inline-block; margin: 0 0 6px; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 48px; background: #e3f0ff; color: #0049dc; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4;">Eenmalig</p>
          <h3 id="step1-title" style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(26px, 2.2vw, 32px); line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 600; color: #0d0064;">Scan</h3>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="slidenav" role="tablist" aria-label="Onderdelen van Scan"><span class="slidenav__bar" aria-hidden="true"></span><button type="button" role="tab" id="step1-tab-0" aria-controls="step1-slide-0" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0" data-slide-tab="0">Waarom</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="step1-tab-1" aria-controls="step1-slide-1" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-slide-tab="1">Aanpak</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="step1-tab-2" aria-controls="step1-slide-2" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-slide-tab="2">Resultaat</button></div>
      <div class="slides-scroll" data-lenis-prevent><div class="slides" data-slides-track><section role="tabpanel" id="step1-slide-0" aria-labelledby="step1-tab-0" class="slide is-active" data-slide="0"><p class="pop-quote">Jullie branding, jullie keuzes.<br class="br-desk"> Ik begin met <span class="qk">vragen<svg viewBox="0 0 220 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M120 6 C 60 2, 8 14, 6 36 C 4 58, 70 66, 120 64 C 175 62, 216 50, 214 32 C 212 12, 160 4, 100 8"></path></svg></span>, <span class="qk">luisteren<svg viewBox="0 0 220 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M118 5 C 62 1, 9 13, 7 35 C 5 57, 66 67, 118 65 C 172 63, 215 51, 213 33 C 211 13, 162 3, 96 9"></path></svg></span> en <span class="qk">kijken<svg viewBox="0 0 220 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M118 5 C 62 1, 9 13, 7 35 C 5 57, 66 67, 118 65 C 172 63, 215 51, 213 33 C 211 13, 162 3, 96 9"></path></svg></span>.</p><p class="pop-lead">Er ligt al veel, en over het meeste is goed nagedacht. Alleen ligt het verspreid over teams, tools en bestanden. Voordat het fundament er kan komen, breng ik alles in kaart: wat er ligt, wat klopt, wat dubbel is en wat ontbreekt.</p></section><section role="tabpanel" id="step1-slide-1" aria-labelledby="step1-tab-1" class="slide" data-slide="1" hidden><ol class="pop-tl"><li><span class="pop-tl__n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><h4>Toegang</h4><p>Ik krijg leestoegang tot jullie tools en bestanden.</p></li><li><span class="pop-tl__n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><h4>Gesprekken</h4><p>Met de verantwoordelijke van elk team. Waar staan jullie achter en waar lopen jullie tegenaan?</p><div class="pb"><span class="pb__ill"><svg viewBox="14 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="20.5" y="5.5" width="50" height="50" rx="8" fill="#0d0064"/><rect x="17" y="9" width="50" height="50" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-width="2"/><g transform="translate(26 18) scale(1.3333)"><path d="M22 6.75003H19.2111C18.61 6.75003 18.3094 6.75003 18.026 6.66421C17.7426 6.5784 17.4925 6.41168 16.9923 6.07823C16.2421 5.57806 15.3862 5.00748 14.961 4.87875C14.5359 4.75003 14.085 4.75003 13.1833 4.75003C11.9571 4.75003 11.1667 4.75003 10.6154 4.97839C10.0641 5.20675 9.63056 5.6403 8.76347 6.50739L8.00039 7.27047C7.80498 7.46588 7.70727 7.56359 7.64695 7.66005C7.42335 8.01764 7.44813 8.47708 7.70889 8.80854C7.77924 8.89796 7.88689 8.98459 8.10218 9.15785C8.89796 9.79827 10.0452 9.73435 10.7658 9.00945L12 7.76789H13L19 13.8036C19.5523 14.3592 19.5523 15.2599 19 15.8155C18.4477 16.3711 17.5523 16.3711 17 15.8155L16.5 15.3125M13.5 12.2947L16.5 15.3125M16.5 15.3125C17.0523 15.8681 17.0523 16.7689 16.5 17.3244C15.9477 17.88 15.0523 17.88 14.5 17.3244L13.5 16.3185M13.5 16.3185C14.0523 16.874 14.0523 17.7748 13.5 18.3304C12.9477 18.8859 12.0523 18.8859 11.5 18.3304L10 16.8214M13.5 16.3185L11.5 14.3185M9.5 16.3185L10 16.8214M10 16.8214C10.5523 17.377 10.5523 18.2778 10 18.8334C9.44772 19.3889 8.55229 19.3889 8 18.8334L5.17637 15.9509C4.59615 15.3586 4.30604 15.0625 3.93435 14.9062C3.56266 14.75 3.14808 14.75 2.31894 14.75H2" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><path d="M22 14.75H19.5" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><path d="M8.5 6.75003L2 6.75003" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/></g><g transform="translate(67 9)"><circle r="8.5" fill="#ffc518" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-width="1.75"/><path d="M-3.6 0.3l2.4 2.4 4.8-5" fill="none" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g></svg></span><div><strong>Designers in huis? Juist fijn.</strong>Zij weten het beste waar ze tegenaan lopen, dus hen heb ik nodig.</div></div></li><li><span class="pop-tl__n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><h4>In kaart brengen</h4><p>Ik leg alles naast elkaar: wat klopt, wat dubbel is, wat ontbreekt. Met korte lijntjes naar de verantwoordelijken voor vragen.</p></li><li><span class="pop-tl__n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><h4>Rapport</h4><p>Je ontvangt een helder rapport van wat er ligt. Bij een grote scan presenteer ik het, zodat iedereen het in één keer hoort.</p></li><li><span class="pop-tl__n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><h4>Plan en prijs</h4><p>Met een vaste prijs voor de vervolgstappen: Fundament en Overdracht.</p></li></ol></section><section role="tabpanel" id="step1-slide-2" aria-labelledby="step1-tab-2" class="slide" data-slide="2" hidden><ul class="pop-res"><li><span class="pop-res__ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.4375 1.02344C17.8281 1.41406 17.8281 2 17.4375 2.35156L7.125 12.6641C6.77344 13.0547 6.1875 13.0547 5.83594 12.6641L0.523438 7.35156C0.132812 7 0.132812 6.41406 0.523438 6.02344C0.875 5.67188 1.46094 5.67188 1.8125 6.02344L6.5 10.7109L16.1484 1.02344C16.5 0.671875 17.0859 0.671875 17.4375 1.02344Z"></path></svg></span><span><strong>Een helder rapport</strong> van wat er ligt.</span></li><li><span class="pop-res__ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.4375 1.02344C17.8281 1.41406 17.8281 2 17.4375 2.35156L7.125 12.6641C6.77344 13.0547 6.1875 13.0547 5.83594 12.6641L0.523438 7.35156C0.132812 7 0.132812 6.41406 0.523438 6.02344C0.875 5.67188 1.46094 5.67188 1.8125 6.02344L6.5 10.7109L16.1484 1.02344C16.5 0.671875 17.0859 0.671875 17.4375 1.02344Z"></path></svg></span><span><strong>Een plan met vaste prijs</strong> voor de vervolgstappen: Fundament en Overdracht.</span></li></ul></section></div></div>
