      <div class="slides-scroll" data-lenis-prevent><div class="slides" data-slides-track><section role="tabpanel" id="step2-slide-0" aria-labelledby="step2-tab-0" class="slide is-active" data-slide="0"><p class="pop-quote">AI is zo goed als de context die het krijgt.<br class="br-desk"> Het <span class="qk">fundament<svg viewBox="0 0 220 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M118 5 C 62 1, 9 13, 7 35 C 5 57, 66 67, 118 65 C 172 63, 215 51, 213 33 C 211 13, 162 3, 96 9"></path></svg></span> is die context.</p><p class="pop-lead">Eén bron van waarheid waar iedereen uit put, mens én AI. Omdat elk team in de scan input heeft gegeven, is dit niet mijn fundament maar dat van jullie. Dat is wat het laat werken.</p></section><section role="tabpanel" id="step2-slide-1" aria-labelledby="step2-tab-1" class="slide" data-slide="1" hidden><ol class="pop-tl"><li><span class="pop-tl__n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><h4>Keuzes maken</h4><p>Uit alles wat de scan opleverde kiezen we wat de basis wordt: logo, kleuren, typografie, iconen en andere design tokens die alles consistent houden.</p><div class="pb"><span class="pb__ill"><svg viewBox="14 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="20.5" y="5.5" width="50" height="50" rx="8" fill="#0d0064"/><rect x="17" y="9" width="50" height="50" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-width="2"/><g transform="translate(26 18) scale(1.3333)"><path d="M22 6.75003H19.2111C18.61 6.75003 18.3094 6.75003 18.026 6.66421C17.7426 6.5784 17.4925 6.41168 16.9923 6.07823C16.2421 5.57806 15.3862 5.00748 14.961 4.87875C14.5359 4.75003 14.085 4.75003 13.1833 4.75003C11.9571 4.75003 11.1667 4.75003 10.6154 4.97839C10.0641 5.20675 9.63056 5.6403 8.76347 6.50739L8.00039 7.27047C7.80498 7.46588 7.70727 7.56359 7.64695 7.66005C7.42335 8.01764 7.44813 8.47708 7.70889 8.80854C7.77924 8.89796 7.88689 8.98459 8.10218 9.15785C8.89796 9.79827 10.0452 9.73435 10.7658 9.00945L12 7.76789H13L19 13.8036C19.5523 14.3592 19.5523 15.2599 19 15.8155C18.4477 16.3711 17.5523 16.3711 17 15.8155L16.5 15.3125M13.5 12.2947L16.5 15.3125M16.5 15.3125C17.0523 15.8681 17.0523 16.7689 16.5 17.3244C15.9477 17.88 15.0523 17.88 14.5 17.3244L13.5 16.3185M13.5 16.3185C14.0523 16.874 14.0523 17.7748 13.5 18.3304C12.9477 18.8859 12.0523 18.8859 11.5 18.3304L10 16.8214M13.5 16.3185L11.5 14.3185M9.5 16.3185L10 16.8214M10 16.8214C10.5523 17.377 10.5523 18.2778 10 18.8334C9.44772 19.3889 8.55229 19.3889 8 18.8334L5.17637 15.9509C4.59615 15.3586 4.30604 15.0625 3.93435 14.9062C3.56266 14.75 3.14808 14.75 2.31894 14.75H2" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><path d="M22 14.75H19.5" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><path d="M8.5 6.75003L2 6.75003" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/></g><g transform="translate(67 9)"><circle r="8.5" fill="#ffc518" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-width="1.75"/><path d="M-3.6 0.3l2.4 2.4 4.8-5" fill="none" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g></svg></span><div><strong>Designers in huis?</strong>Dan zijn zij mijn eerste gesprekspartner. Zij weten waarom iets is zoals het is, en dat is precies wat het fundament nodig heeft.</div></div></li><li><span class="pop-tl__n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><h4>Bouwstenen</h4><p>Componenten voor websites en apps en templates voor jullie uitingen, zoals social posts, presentaties en e-mails.</p></li><li><span class="pop-tl__n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><h4>Tone of voice</h4><p>Ligt jullie tone of voice vast? Dan maken we er regels van waar AI mee kan werken.</p><div class="pb"><span class="pb__ill"><svg viewBox="14 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="20.5" y="5.5" width="50" height="50" rx="8" fill="#0d0064"/><rect x="17" y="9" width="50" height="50" rx="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#0d0064" stroke-width="2"/><g transform="translate(26 18) scale(1.3333)"><circle cx="11" cy="6.5" r="4" strok