iewd wordt.</span></li><li><span class="pop-res__ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.4375 1.02344C17.8281 1.41406 17.8281 2 17.4375 2.35156L7.125 12.6641C6.77344 13.0547 6.1875 13.0547 5.83594 12.6641L0.523438 7.35156C0.132812 7 0.132812 6.41406 0.523438 6.02344C0.875 5.67188 1.46094 5.67188 1.8125 6.02344L6.5 10.7109L16.1484 1.02344C16.5 0.671875 17.0859 0.671875 17.4375 1.02344Z"></path></svg></span><span><strong>De bron is van jullie,</strong> niet van mij.</span></li></ul></section></div></div>
